cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "The order-6 example of the Skolem survey has no zeros"
abstract: "A Lean 4 proof that the order-6 linear recurrence sequence of Section 8.3 of Bacik et al., A survey of the Skolem and Positivity Problems for linear recurrence sequences (2026), has no zeros. The argument is a 23-adic valuation argument in the framework of twisted zeros of Bilu, Luca, Nieuwveld, Ouaknine and Worrell."
type: software
authors:
